            "review_text": "Peter M\n13 contributions\n0\nTake it easy. A very good alternative for seafood\nDec 2014 • Friends\nMy Vietnamese girlfriend and I ate here a week ago after a recommendation from her friend. We were not disappointed ordering a single dish of crawfish, prawns, squid etc which we shared. It was not possible to finish all.and the staff were attentive the whole time. Nothing read to much trouble. Not to mention the beautiful view over Westlake and the location close to the expat areas around Xuan Dieu.\n\nAll up our bill was around 650,000 VND and we could not finish all the food.\n\nGive the staff a break, they are in their first month or so here, and they just want to make the customers happy.\nRead more\nWritten December 14, 2014",
